@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
title 中心化动态规划：物理执行流程

participant "TaskGraphService" as G
box "Master Bot runtime" #D6EAF8
participant "中心化\nTaskPlanner" as P
participant "中心化\nTaskDispatcher" as D
end box
box "被选执行 runtime" #FCF3CF
participant "TaskRunner" as R
end box
participant "实际 executor" as X

G -> P : PLAN_REQUESTED(TaskContext)
P -> G : report(PLAN, PlanResult)
G -> D : DISPATCH_REQUESTED(TaskNode)
D -> G : report(DISPATCH, TaskNodePatch)
G -> R : EXECUTION_REQUESTED(TaskNode)
R -> X : 启动节点执行
R -> G : report(EXECUTION_STARTED / START_FAILED)
X -> G : report(EXECUTION_RESULT)
G -> P : 下一轮 PLAN_REQUESTED\n始终路由至 Master runtime

note over P,D
Master runtime 物理承载规划与派发；
执行 runtime 只承载被派发节点的 Runner。
end note
@enduml
